1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:01,983
Why don't you just let me get some rest?

2
00:00:02,188 --> 00:00:05,178
(Sheldon:)How can you sleep?
I'm not done making you feel better.

3
00:00:05,391 --> 00:00:09,881
(Sheldon:)I still have to put a cold rag on your head,
sing to you...

4
00:00:10,129 --> 00:00:12,289
(Sheldon:)...and apply VapoRub to your chest.

5
00:00:19,772 --> 00:00:23,302
You wanna rub something on my chest?

6
00:00:24,143 --> 00:00:27,773
(Sheldon:)Yes. All over it.

7
00:00:31,284 --> 00:00:33,314
Ahem. Maybe we should start with that.

8
00:00:35,321 --> 00:00:37,481
(Sheldon:)Now you're being a responsible patient.

9
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:52,827
(Sheldon:)Now, you may notice some tingling.

10
00:00:53,206 --> 00:01:02,026
(Amy:)Oh, I'm counting on it.

